@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #235573
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EAF4F8
skinparam linetype ortho
title SaigonBite - Overall Domain Class Model (Proposed)\nUC03 / UC04 / UC07 / UC10 / UC13 / UC16\nVõ Tấn Tài - 524H0126

class Customer {
  customerId
}
class LocalCustomer {
  mobileNumber
}
class TouristCustomer {
  passportDetails
  emailAddress
}
class Hub {
  hubId
  name [proposed]
  capacitySetting [unit / threshold To Confirm]
}
class Brand {
  brandId
  name [proposed]
}
class Voucher {
  voucherId [proposed]
}
class MenuItem {
  menuItemId
  name [proposed]
  currentPrice [proposed]
}
class Order {
  id
  status
  paymentStatus [proposed from UC03/UC04]
  paymentMethod
  totalDue
  deliveryAddressSnapshot [proposed]
  clientRequestId [proposed]
  rejectionReason [optional]
  failureReason [optional]
  cashCollected [optional]
  placedAt [proposed]
  updatedAt [proposed]
}
class OrderLine {
  quantity
  unitPrice
  nameSnapshot [proposed]
}
class OrderMilestone <<proposed>> {
  status
  occurredAt
}
class Shipper {
  shipperId
}
class ManagementReport <<derived, proposed>> {
  reportType
  period
  scope
  dataStatus
}

Customer "1" -- "0..*" Order : places
Customer <|-- LocalCustomer
Customer <|-- TouristCustomer
Hub "1" -- "0..*" Order : fulfils
Hub "0..*" -- "1..*" Brand : works with (Hub count proposed)
Shipper "0..1" -- "0..*" Order : current assignment
Order "1" *-- "1..*" OrderLine : contains
Order "1" *-- "0..*" OrderMilestone : records (proposed)
Voucher "0..1" -- "0..*" Order : applied to (reuse proposed)
OrderLine "0..*" -- "1" MenuItem : refers to
Brand "1" -right- "0..*" MenuItem
ManagementReport ..> Order
ManagementReport ..> Hub

note bottom of Hub
  UC13: capacity unit, limit, effective time,
  and delete/archive policy To Confirm.
end note
note bottom of ManagementReport
  UC16: derived from Order and Hub (proposed),
  not a confirmed stored entity.
  KPI definitions and period To Confirm.
end note
note as N1
  The official Case Study confirms customer types, limited
  hub capacity, hub-brand work and at most one voucher/order.
  Existing UC07/UC10 model supports the core Order links.
  UC03/UC04 drafts are on Khang's separate branch.
  Their added attributes and milestones are Proposed;
  state vocabulary still needs team reconciliation.
end note
N1 .. Order
footer AI-assisted draft; student review required before submission
@enduml
